CPU PPCG generalized-eigenproblem regression based on 009_PW_UPF201_USPP.

Geometry, pseudopotentials and k mesh are inherited from that fixture.
SCF uses the PW reciprocal-space criterion with scf_thr=1e-16 to converge
forces and stress; scf_nmax and pw_diag_nmax are 200. The initial
pw_diag_thr and ppcg_rr_step retain their defaults.

References were computed independently with BPCG using the same numerical
inputs, then checked against PPCG. Existing Autotest tolerances are unchanged.
At this deliberately tight SCF threshold, PPCG may report iteration-limit
warnings for residuals near the 1e-14 numerical floor; these diagnostics
remain visible. See docs/advanced/scf/ppcg_validation.md for the protocol,
comparison results and limits of the accuracy claims.
